  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Reveal Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Primary web-flag reveal action.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-primary\" type=\"button\">Показати веб-прапор <svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-primary{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;background:#defa8d;color:#142e3a;border:0;border-radius:6px;min-height:48px;padding:10px 18px;font:700 14px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-primary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #247c83;outline-offset:5px}@media(hover:hover){.ds-primary:hover{background:#c9ed73}}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-primary{width:100%;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;padding:10px 14px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Copy Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-copy",
      "description": "Compact secondary action on the dark reveal panel.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-copy\" type=\"button\">Скопіювати</button>",
      "css": ".ds-copy{border:1px solid #79979f;border-radius:5px;background:transparent;color:#fff;padding:4px 10px;font:12px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-copy:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #247c83;outline-offset:5px}@media(hover:hover){.ds-copy:hover{background:#264955}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Brand Link",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "The masthead identity, kept unbroken.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-brand\" href=\"#\">Cyber&nbsp;ICE&nbsp;Box<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M7 17 17 7M7 7h10v10\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-brand{font-family:Manrope,ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;font-size:21px;font-weight:750;text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-.7px;white-space:nowrap;color:#142e3a}.ds-brand svg{display:inline-flex;vertical-align:middle;margin-left:12px;color:#0d767b}.ds-brand:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #247c83;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-brand{font-size:19px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Flag Panel",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "flag-panel",
      "description": "Dark container for the first task and reveal action.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-flag\"><span class=\"ds-number\">01</span><div><h2>Заберіть веб-прапор</h2><p>Це значення створено для вашого запуску.</p></div><span class=\"ds-status\"><span></span>Веб-сервер відповідає</span></section>",
      "css": ".ds-flag{display:grid;grid-template-columns:32px 1fr auto;align-items:start;gap:24px;padding:38px 34px 30px;background:#142e3a;color:#fff;border-radius:12px;font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-number{font:500 13px/1.6 ui-monospace,monospace;color:#91a9b0;padding-top:5px}.ds-flag h2{font:650 27px/1.25 Manrope,ui-sans-serif,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.5px;margin:0 0 14px}.ds-flag p{max-width:540px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#c2d2d6;margin:0}.ds-status{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:#c2d2d6;white-space:nowrap;padding-top:5px}.ds-status>span{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#defa8d}@media(max-width:850px){.ds-flag{grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;gap:18px;padding:30px 24px}.ds-status{grid-column:2;margin-top:4px}}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-flag{gap:12px;padding:25px 20px;border-radius:8px}.ds-flag h2{font-size:24px}.ds-flag p{font-size:14px}.ds-status{font-size:11px}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Terminal",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "terminal",
      "description": "Secondary SSH command example with a plain-language VPN note.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-terminal\"><div class=\"ds-terminal-head\"><span>Термінал</span><span>SSH / 2222</span></div><pre><code><span class=\"ds-prompt\">$</span> ssh -p 2222 demo@@VPN_ADDRESS@\n<span class=\"ds-comment\"># пароль: cybericebox</span>\n<span class=\"ds-prompt\">$</span> cat flag.txt</code></pre><p>Зовнішнє посилання відкриває лише веб. Для SSH потрібен VPN.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-terminal{min-width:0;border:1px solid #c7d7d6;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;overflow:hidden;color:#142e3a;font:16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-terminal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;border-bottom:1px solid #d9e3df;padding:12px 18px;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.4px;color:#48616b}.ds-terminal pre{padding:19px 18px 0;margin:0;white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;font:13px/1.9 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Consolas,monospace}.ds-prompt{color:#14747a}.ds-comment{color:#617980}.ds-terminal>p{border-top:1px solid #e4eae8;margin:20px 0 0;padding:12px 18px;color:#526c72;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65}@media(max-width:600px){.ds-terminal pre{font-size:12px}}"
    },
    {
